{"id":"2d52ad4f119b4a14","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-provable-formula.md","title":"Provable Formula","display":"df-provable-formula — Provable Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-provable-formula","aliases":["89-df-provable-formula"],"display":"df-provable-formula — Provable Formula","depends_on":["[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-provable-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-provable-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provable-formula — Provable Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e7227755a8473e0\" href=\"?note=2e7227755a8473e0\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus\">89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_T=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_T=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}A\">\\(T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}A\\)</span> 取已有一阶算术演算，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 可枚举。</li>\n<li>最后一式另假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RE}(\\{\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\mid A\\in T\\})\">\\(\\operatorname{RE}(\\{\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\mid A\\in T\\})\\)</span>，并固定可证明性谓词条目所要求的公理枚举程序和表示环境；此时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\)</span> 为该条目的同一数值证明关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_T\\mid T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\varphi\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)&amp;=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_T\\mid\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ ((y,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T)\\}\n\\quad(\\operatorname{RE}(g_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}}[T])).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_T\\mid T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\varphi\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)&amp;=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_T\\mid\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ ((y,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T)\\}\n\\quad(\\operatorname{RE}(g_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}}[T])).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可证句子集首先按已有有限证明演算定义，因此一般理论的 ArSound 不再隐含可枚举性。对原数值证明接口的原适用域，第二式给出完全相同的句子集合。数值证明关系、对象图公式与元层可证句子集仍严格分开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"2e7227755a8473e0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_T=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}A","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RE}(\\{\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\mid A\\in T\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)&\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_T\\mid T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\varphi\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)&=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_T\\mid\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ ((y,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T)\\}\n\\quad(\\operatorname{RE}(g_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}}[T])).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1440,"backlinks":[{"id":"c1c8665663a75504","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"646431d492b9ae8a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0ce064881a79d6f7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cbb11883655db5cd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7ed22bf7259dd6b3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4cc05e68647fcda4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9aca87310232fb2f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6cbce44a943995a0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)$ is the set of $T$-provable sentences from\n[[89-df-provable-formula]]."},{"id":"f367207d33b1e75f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"19a5fceb5d504d9f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cae39eab3d6562b6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}$ (see [[89-df-provable-formula]])."},{"id":"f04ebe4ce16b21f5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-397","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-provable-formula]]"}],"outgoing":["841985de31202f85","2e7227755a8473e0"]}